"Where is AI?"
AI is in a lot of everyday things we see. For example, some people use AI to create posts to advertise their businesses, or teachers can use it to create homework
Students identify AI systems they interact with every day and classify:

What the AI does
The AI answers things we dont know how to answer

What data is uses
It uses already uploaded data on websites to generate the answers we need

What business problem it solves
AI can do things that would take a human a lot longer to do, so it can do certain tasks more efficiently saving a business time and money

Who benefits
Everyone can benefit from AI 

What could go wrong
AI can be wrong sometimes, and if it gets too advanced some people worry it can take over jobs
